      en: "Tashkentland is an amusement park in Tashkent, Uzbekistan, opened in 2010. Covering 20 hectares, it features over 30 rides and attractions, including a roller coaster and a Ferris wheel. The park has themed zones and hosts concerts and festivals. It receives more than one million visitors each year, contributing significantly to local tourism. Modernization projects continue to enhance its offerings.",
